---

<section id="about" class="px-6 md:px-20 py-20">
  <div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto">
    <div class="section-label bg-orange-light text-secondary mb-8 -rotate-1">
      <i class="fa-solid fa-user mr-1"></i> About Me
    </div>

    <div class="flex flex-col md:flex-row gap-10 items-start">
      <!-- Left: Text -->
      <div class="flex-1">
        <h2 class="text-3xl md:text-4xl font-black mb-6 leading-tight">
          Code is how I <span class="text-primary">think</span>,
          build is how I <span class="text-secondary">learn</span>.
        </h2>
        <div class="space-y-4 text-muted leading-relaxed">
          <p>
            I'm <strong class="text-ink font-semibold">Muhamad Riza Pahlevi</strong>, a Software Engineer with a passion for turning ideas into real, impactful products. I started coding at an early age and haven't stopped since.
          </p>
          <p>
            Experienced in <strong class="text-ink font-semibold">full-stack development</strong>, software architecture, web &amp; mobile apps, REST APIs, database management, and solving complex technical challenges. I thrive on curiosity, continuous learning, and building things that matter.
          </p>
          <p>
            Currently studying <strong class="text-ink font-semibold">Software Engineering</strong> at SMK Taruna Bhakti (2024–Present), while actively competing in hackathons and building real-world projects.
          </p>
        </div>

        <!-- Quick stats -->
        <div class="grid grid-cols-3 gap-4 mt-8">
          <div class="neo-card p-4 text-center">
            <div class="text-2xl font-black text-primary">2+</div>
            <div class="text-xs text-muted font-medium mt-1">Hackathons</div>
          </div>
          <div class="neo-card p-4 text-center">
            <div class="text-2xl font-black text-secondary">10+</div>
            <div class="text-xs text-muted font-medium mt-1">Projects</div>
          </div>
          <div class="neo-card p-4 text-center">
            <div class="text-2xl font-black text-success">4th</div>
            <div class="text-xs text-muted font-medium mt-1">Place Finish</div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- Right: Decorative / Education -->
      <div class="flex-1 w-full">
        <div class="neo-card p-6 mb-6">
          <div class="flex items-center gap-3 mb-4">
            <div class="w-10 h-10 bg-primary border-2 border-ink rounded-lg flex items-center justify-center text-white">
              <i class="fa-solid fa-graduation-cap"></i>
            </div>
            <h3 class="font-bold text-lg">Education</h3>
          </div>
          <div class="border-l-4 border-primary pl-4">
            <h4 class="font-bold">SMKS Taruna Bhakti</h4>
            <p class="text-sm text-muted">Software Engineering (RPL)</p>
            <p class="text-xs text-muted mt-1 font-mono">2024 — Present</p>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="neo-card p-6">
          <div class="flex items-center gap-3 mb-4">
            <div class="w-10 h-10 bg-secondary border-2 border-ink rounded-lg flex items-center justify-center text-white">
              <i class="fa-solid fa-heart"></i>
            </div>
            <h3 class="font-bold text-lg">What Drives Me</h3>
          </div>
          <div class="flex flex-wrap gap-2">
            <span class="neo-tag bg-blue-light text-primary">Curiosity</span>
            <span class="neo-tag bg-orange-light text-secondary">Problem Solving</span>
            <span class="neo-tag bg-green-light text-success">Leadership</span>
            <span class="neo-tag bg-blue-light text-primary">Adaptability</span>
            <span class="neo-tag bg-orange-light text-secondary">Continuous Learning</span>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
